{"3622260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "April Grove", "steam_appid": 3622260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3737280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a load off, enjoy the scenery, chop a tree or two; the world of April Grove is yours to explore and savor. <br>It’s a peaceful world without a danger in sight. All that stands between you and greatness is </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/23e229f356a3ed8ed654eeb800592e33.poster.avif?t=1767979244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/23e229f356a3ed8ed654eeb800592e33.webm?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/23e229f356a3ed8ed654eeb800592e33.mp4?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">your efforts and optimization. Gather logs, trade them for gold and purchase food, upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> or even donate to the local wishing well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/1480a08591c3c1e692fc86067d6979b7.poster.avif?t=1767979244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/1480a08591c3c1e692fc86067d6979b7.webm?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/1480a08591c3c1e692fc86067d6979b7.mp4?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With each log gain experience and grow in your skill so that you can cut and clear the daunting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">trees with greater ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/8bf231b28e02aa4b5867262a11692419.poster.avif?t=1767979244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/8bf231b28e02aa4b5867262a11692419.webm?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/8bf231b28e02aa4b5867262a11692419.mp4?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">April Grove lets you move at your own pace and do as you please, so chop chop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features that <i>April Grove</i> has to offer:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mystical forest and meet its citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the axe of the forester who came before. Take your woodcutting skill from 0 to full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful world and OST to lose yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily play in the background. Chop wood while you work for maximum gains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize for your style of play with different foods, necklaces and axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a guy or a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet various animals to varying degrees of success.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take a load off, enjoy the scenery, chop a tree or two; the world of April Grove is yours to explore and savor. <br>It’s a peaceful world without a danger in sight. All that stands between you and greatness is </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/23e229f356a3ed8ed654eeb800592e33.poster.avif?t=1767979244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/23e229f356a3ed8ed654eeb800592e33.webm?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/23e229f356a3ed8ed654eeb800592e33.mp4?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">your efforts and optimization. Gather logs, trade them for gold and purchase food, upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> or even donate to the local wishing well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/1480a08591c3c1e692fc86067d6979b7.poster.avif?t=1767979244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/1480a08591c3c1e692fc86067d6979b7.webm?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/1480a08591c3c1e692fc86067d6979b7.mp4?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With each log gain experience and grow in your skill so that you can cut and clear the daunting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">trees with greater ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/8bf231b28e02aa4b5867262a11692419.poster.avif?t=1767979244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/8bf231b28e02aa4b5867262a11692419.webm?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622260/extras/8bf231b28e02aa4b5867262a11692419.mp4?t=1767979244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">April Grove lets you move at your own pace and do as you please, so chop chop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features that <i>April Grove</i> has to offer:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mystical forest and meet its citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the axe of the forester who came before. Take your woodcutting skill from 0 to full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful world and OST to lose yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily play in the background. Chop wood while you work for maximum gains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize for your style of play with different foods, necklaces and axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a guy or a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet various animals to varying degrees of success.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Undertake your new job as a forester in a mystic and peaceful wood. Chop, gather, level up and unravel the expansive forest and its splendor at your own pace, one log at a time!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</str